# This fixture is measurement apparatus, not source. Two tasks compare bytes exactly: t08 asserts
# trailing whitespace and blank runs, t10 asserts every original line survives unchanged.
#
# `-text` disables Git's end-of-line normalization, so the committed bytes survive checkout unchanged
# rather than being rewritten to the platform convention. Without it, a fresh clone on Windows would
# fail those two tasks for reasons unrelated to the executor under test, and the failure would be
# indistinguishable from a model error.
#
# This file lives at the fixture root so it travels with the fixture when the runner copies it into a
# standalone repository for an attempt worktree.
* -text
